.TH MYGREP 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search for a string in file lines
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.B int mygrep(FILE *fp, const char *search_str, char ***matches);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B mygrep
function searches the file stream for lines containing
.I search_str .
Matching lines are stored in the dynamically allocated
.I matches
array.
The function returns the number of matching lines and -1 on failure.
.SH AUTHOR
Subhan Ahmad
